-df-ordering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Corollary 4.11, p.61, scan 76; proviso at p.60, scan 75"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇；保留符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 若已出现则为二元，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\max\">\\(0,\\max\\)</span> 若已出现则为常量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;^{(2)},0,\\max\\}\">\\(\\sigma=\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;^{(2)},0,\\max\\}\\)</span> 为兼容词汇合并。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\sigma]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z=\\mathrm{FV}(\\Phi)\">\\(Z=\\mathrm{FV}(\\Phi)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinOrd}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinOrd}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathcal K_\\sigma\\)</span> 在下面定义，明确要求至少两个元素及真正的最小、最大端点。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\sigma]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span>；下式等价谓词同时量化模型与全个体赋值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\mid |\\,|A|\\,|\\geq2\\land &lt;^A\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|A|)\\land\\forall a\\in|A|\\;((a=0^A\\lor(0^A,a)\\in&lt;^A)\\land(a=\\max^A\\lor(a,\\max^A)\\in&lt;^A))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\mid |\\,|A|\\,|\\geq2\\land &lt;^A\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|A|)\\land\\forall a\\in|A|\\;((a=0^A\\lor(0^A,a)\\in&lt;^A)\\land(a=\\max^A\\lor(a,\\max^A)\\in&lt;^A))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\equiv_{LFP,\\sigma}^{\\geq2,&lt;}\\beta\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathcal K_\\sigma\\;\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;((A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\alpha[\\gamma])\\leftrightarrow(A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\beta[\\gamma])).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\equiv_{LFP,\\sigma}^{\\geq2,&lt;}\\beta\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathcal K_\\sigma\\;\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;((A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\alpha[\\gamma])\\leftrightarrow(A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\beta[\\gamma])).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists R^{(k)}\\notin\\operatorname{Sym}(\\sigma)\\;\\exists\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\;\\exists\\bar c\\in\\{0,\\max\\}^k\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\sigma\\cup\\{R\\}}\\;\\left(|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)|=k\\land\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cap Z=\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cup Z\\land\\Phi\\equiv_{LFP,\\sigma}^{\\geq2,&lt;}[\\operatorname{LFP}_{R,\\bar x}\\varphi](\\bar c)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists R^{(k)}\\notin\\operatorname{Sym}(\\sigma)\\;\\exists\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\;\\exists\\bar c\\in\\{0,\\max\\}^k\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\sigma\\cup\\{R\\}}\\;\\left(|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)|=k\\land\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cap Z=\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cup Z\\land\\Phi\\equiv_{LFP,\\sigma}^{\\geq2,&lt;}[\\operatorname{LFP}_{R,\\bar x}\\varphi](\\bar c)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Corollary 4.11，印刷页 61，扫描页 76；端点与单元素例外见 p.60 脚注及 Proviso 1.15。显式区分两个端点后可编码多个控制状态，单元素输入可另行用 FO 分支处理，不能在同一个裸正规形式中假装 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\ne\\max\">\\(0\\ne\\max\\)</span> 自动成立。核对陈述与归约证明结构，未逐式展开编码。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-lfp","status":"resolved","id":"d8799e17a4ba0440","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-lfp]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-positivity","status":"resolved","id":"0d59539a54286933","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-positivity]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":